COMMENT ON TABLE "public"."bob_app_map_edges" IS 'App Atlas terrain graph: directed edges between entities classified in bob_capability_map. Generated by CI static analysis. Each edge records source->target with kind, evidence_class, and retirement_status. Sibling to bob_capability_map (nodes). Issue #231, epic #228.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."bob_app_map_edges"."edge_kind" IS 'Edge relationship kind. Data layer: reads/writes/calls/invokes/imports/references/fk_references. Control layer (0321): triggers (table->fn a trigger fires) and secured_by (table->helper fn its RLS policy references). Control-layer edges are structural presence signals only -- they say LOOK HERE, never that a policy will block a given actor.';



